{
    "version": 1,
    "id": "large_fabric",
    "description": "Two switches and six hosts: SLDs, MLDs of 4, 8 and 16 LDs, bound and unbound capacity",
    "_comment": [
        "switch_a: four hosts (VCS 0-3), each with an SLD and two LDs of the 16-LD MLD on port 8. The",
        "other eight LDs of that MLD and all eight of the MLD on port 9 are FM-owned and can be bound.",
        "Ports 10 and 11 have no device: one link is down, one is training.",
        "switch_b: two hosts. Host 0 has an SLD and LD 0 of the MLD on port 4, host 1 has LD 1; LDs 2",
        "and 3 and the SLD on port 3, which needs maintenance, are unbound. Port 5 holds a PCIe device.",
        "An SLD port is bound to one VCS, and each LD to one host or to none (Sections 7.2.3.1, 7.3.4)."
    ],
